  "page": 204,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.76272583007812,
        139.9644775390625,
        82.6147232055664
      ],
      "text": "Justification",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        89.71263885498047,
        527.4076538085938,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "Ambulatory care:  Outcomes from models of MDR-TB care based mainly on clinic-based ambulatory",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.973567962646484,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        103.02259063720703,
        527.2587280273438,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "treatment were compared with those using mainly hospital-based inpatient treatment. The data used",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98784351348877,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        527.4035034179688,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "came from cost–effectiveness studies in four countries, namely: Estonia and the Russian Federation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.14674377441406,
        527.426025390625,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "(122) (123) (124) [Tomsk oblast]  , Peru   and Philippines  .The design of these observational studies did",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.62269592285156,
        527.4473876953125,
        157.06568908691406
      ],
      "text": "not allow direct comparison of effects between models of care. Because none of the studies were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.8227081298828,
        527.5703125,
        170.2657012939453
      ],
      "text": "randomized controlled trials, the evidence was considered to be of very low quality. Cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.963288307189941,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        169.02272033691406,
        527.4068603515625,
        183.46571350097656
      ],
      "text": "was modelled for all possible WHO Member States in a probabilistic analysis of the data from the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        180.9467315673828,
        160.87310791015625,
        196.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "(125) four countries  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        203.816650390625,
        527.4022827148438,
        218.36964416503906
      ],
      "text": "Decentralized care:  As the use of Xpert  MTB/RIF expands, more patients will be diagnosed and  ®",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        217.12660217285156,
        527.4410400390625,
        231.56959533691406
      ],
      "text": "enrolled on MDR-TB treatment. Having treatment and care provided in decentralized health-care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        230.3267364501953,
        527.4158325195312,
        244.7697296142578
      ],
      "text": "facilities is a practical approach for scaling up treatment and care for patients who are eligible for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        243.52662658691406,
        527.3661499023438,
        257.9696350097656
      ],
      "text": "MDR-TB treatment. Therefore, a systematic review of the treatment and care of bacteriologically",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        256.7266845703125,
        527.4255981445312,
        271.1697082519531
      ],
      "text": "confirmed or clinically diagnosed MDR-TB patients in decentralized versus centralized systems was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.9266357421875,
        527.5003051757812,
        284.3696594238281
      ],
      "text": "conducted to gather evidence on whether the quality of treatment and care is likely to be compromised",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.1265869140625,
        527.0771484375,
        297.5696105957031
      ],
      "text": "with a decentralized approach. Data from both randomized controlled trials and observational studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968955993652344,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.05072021484375,
        527.3992309570312,
        310.7697448730469
      ],
      "text": "(120, 121, 126–133) were analysed, with the majority being from low- and middle-income countries  . The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.956363677978516,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        309.526611328125,
        527.4002685546875,
        323.9696350097656
      ],
      "text": "review provided additional value to the recommendation in the previous guidelines on ambulatory",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        322.7265930175781,
        527.4213256835938,
        337.16961669921875
      ],
      "text": "over hospitalized models of care for MDR-TB patients for which the evidence was examined only for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        334.6506042480469,
        351.46710205078125,
        350.36962890625
      ],
      "text": "(4) treatment and care of patients outside or inside hospitals  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        357.630615234375,
        527.4877319335938,
        372.0736389160156
      ],
      "text": "In the review, decentralized care was defined as care that is provided in the local community where the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.965295791625977,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        370.8305969238281,
        527.4650268554688,
        385.27362060546875
      ],
      "text": "patient lives at non-specialized or peripheral health centres, by community health workers or nurses,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999750137329102,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        384.0306091308594,
        527.4398803710938,
        398.4736328125
      ],
      "text": "non-specialized doctors, community volunteers or treatment supporters. Care could also occur at",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        397.2305908203125,
        527.11669921875,
        411.6736145019531
      ],
      "text": "local venues or at the patient’s home or workplace. Treatment and care included treatment and patient",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.962285041809082,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        410.43060302734375,
        527.385986328125,
        424.8736267089844
      ],
      "text": "support plus injections during the intensive phase. In this group, a brief phase of hospitalization of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.630615234375,
        527.2399291992188,
        438.0736389160156
      ],
      "text": "less than one month was accepted for patients who were in need during the initial phase of treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98133373260498,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        436.8305969238281,
        290.0686340332031,
        451.27362060546875
      ],
      "text": "or when they had any treatment complications.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        458.5345153808594,
        527.3838500976562,
        472.9775390625
      ],
      "text": "Centralized care was defined as inpatient treatment and care provided solely by centres or teams",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.7344970703125,
        527.443359375,
        486.1775207519531
      ],
      "text": "specialized in drug-resistant TB for the duration of the intensive phase of therapy or until culture or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.93450927734375,
        527.5615234375,
        499.3775329589844
      ],
      "text": "smear conversion. Afterwards, patients could have received decentralized care. Centralized care was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996748924255371,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        498.1344909667969,
        527.3960571289062,
        512.5775146484375
      ],
      "text": "usually delivered by specialist doctors or nurses and could include centralized outpatient clinics (i.e.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        511.33447265625,
        404.25531005859375,
        525.7774658203125
      ],
      "text": "outpatient facilities located at or near the site of the centralized hospital).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        533.0383911132812,
        527.3688354492188,
        547.4813842773438
      ],
      "text": "Analysis of the data showed that treatment success and loss to follow-up improved with decentralized",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9738187789917,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.238525390625,
        527.532958984375,
        560.6815185546875
      ],
      "text": "care versus centralized care. However, the risk of death and treatment failure showed minimal difference",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.4384155273438,
        527.4375,
        573.8814086914062
      ],
      "text": "between patients undergoing decentralized care and those receiving centralized care. There were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        572.6385498046875,
        439.05926513671875,
        587.08154296875
      ],
      "text": "limited data on adverse reactions, adherence, acquired drug resistance and cost.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        594.3424072265625,
        527.6124877929688,
        608.785400390625
      ],
      "text": "Both HIV-negative and HIV-positive persons were included in the reviewed studies although the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        607.5424194335938,
        332.5385437011719,
        621.9854125976562
      ],
      "text": "studies did not stratify patients on the basis of HIV status.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.246337890625,
        524.373046875,
        643.6893310546875
      ],
      "text": "There was some discussion regarding the quality of the data. The GDG expressed concerns that health-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95355224609375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        642.4462890625,
        527.3914794921875,
        656.8892822265625
      ],
      "text": "care workers may have selected for the centralized care groups those patients who they thought",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.6464233398438,
        441.0635986328125,
        670.0894165039062
      ],
      "text": "might have a worse prognosis. None of the studies controlled for this risk of bias.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        683.4635620117188,
        209.15652465820312,
        699.3156127929688
      ],
      "text": "Subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        706.5234985351562,
        527.3992309570312,
        720.9664916992188
      ],
      "text": "Decentralized care may not be appropriate for patients with severe TB disease, extremely infectious",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        719.7235107421875,
        524.37646484375,
        734.16650390625
      ],
      "text": "forms of the disease, serious comorbidities or patients for whom treatment adherence is a concern.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        741.4274291992188,
        527.4509887695312,
        755.8704223632812
      ],
      "text": "Measures to protect the safety of patients on MDR-TB regimens – especially those containing new",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        754.6273803710938,
        375.1481628417969,
        769.0703735351562
      ],
      "text": "or novel medicines – need to be maintained in outpatient settings.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "190 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}